  "help.sharelook.attribution_b1": "To respect the creator’s work, an imported handmade map can keep its original title and description when exported again after small edits. A question mark beside a locked field explains this. Your own exported images recognized by this browser, and procedurally or AI-generated maps, keep these fields editable.",
